<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px 0px 72px', background: '#F5F8F2', position: 'relative' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 108, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 2.4 }}>ROLE 02 · DA OFFICER</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0B1F14', letterSpacing: -0.6, marginTop: 8 }}>The staff console</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 532, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 56 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 356, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 30, color: '#0B1F14', lineHeight: 1.42 }}>
          The same scans, read from above. One municipality, every barangay inside it.
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 18 }}>
          A DA Officer does not scan. They watch the signal the farmers produce: volume, share of suspected disease, and which barangay is carrying it this month.
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)', paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>READ-ONLY BY DESIGN</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          A DA Officer cannot scan, cannot change a record, and cannot see another municipality. The console is a window, not an editor.
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ background: '#0B1F14', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 11, fontWeight: 600, color: '#A4DA22', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>SCOPE CHIP</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(245,248,242,0.75)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>
          Every view is filtered to the officer's jurisdiction before the query runs. Data outside it is not fetched, not hidden.
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, paddingBottom: 16, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 136 }}>Overview</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Is pressure rising, and where?</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.6)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
            Four KPIs, a scan-volume trend, the disease mix, and disease pressure ranked by barangay.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 16, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 136 }}>Barangays</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Which one is carrying it?</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.6)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
            A stacked mix per barangay, then a table of scans, suspected count, rate, farmers and a signal column.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 16, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 136 }}>Records</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Which scans sit behind that number?</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.6)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
            Filter by farmer, crop, status or barangay. The same records open as a table or as an image gallery.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, paddingTop: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 136 }}>Farmers</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Who is actually scanning?</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.6)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
            A roster with scan counts, last activity, and whether the farmer allowed reviewed photos to be reused.
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 16, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>AgriSuri PH · Product Scope</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>12 / 19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
